"Lo que este juego ha copiado hasta ahora se elimina; los juegos ya "
"instalados se quedan. La unidad USB no se modifica. Presiona el botón de "
"volver para seguir instalando."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7543
msgid "Stop this game"
msgstr "Detener este juego"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7543
msgid "Stop all"
msgstr "Detener todo"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7545
msgid "Everything copied so far is deleted. The USB drive isn't changed."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo copiado hasta ahora se elimina. La unidad USB no se modifica."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7546
msgid "Keep installing"
msgstr "Seguir instalando"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7550
msgid "There are no games to uninstall"
msgstr "No hay juegos que desinstalar"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7558
#, c-format
msgid "Delete the saves of %s?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar los datos guardados de %s?"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7559
msgid ""
"Its saves and settings, kept when it was uninstalled, are deleted. There "
"is no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Sus datos guardados y ajustes, conservados al desinstalarlo, se eliminan. "
"No hay copia de seguridad ni se puede deshacer."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7568
#, c-format
msgid "Uninstall %s?"
msgstr "¿Desinstalar %s?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7571
msgid ""
"Keep saves: the game goes, its saves and settings stay, and installing it "
"again puts them back. Delete all: the game, its saves and settings go, "
"with no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Conservar datos: el juego se va, sus datos guardados y ajustes se quedan, "
"y al volver a instalarlo se restauran. Eliminar todo: el juego, sus datos "
"guardados y ajustes se van, sin copia de seguridad ni posibilidad de "
"deshacer."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7573
msgid "Keep saves"
msgstr "Conservar datos"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7573
msgid "Delete all"
msgstr "Eliminar todo"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7576
msgid ""
"This deletes the game and all its saves and settings. There is no backup "
"and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Esto elimina el juego y todos sus datos guardados y ajustes. No hay copia "
"de seguridad ni se puede deshacer."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7581
#, c-format
msgid "Deleting the saves of %s"
msgstr "Eliminando los datos guardados de %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7581
#, c-format
msgid "Uninstalling %s"
msgstr "Desinstalando %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7584
#, c-format
msgid "%u files and folders deleted"
msgstr "%u archivos y carpetas eliminados"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7605
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d game is waiting in PC5's INSTALL folders (its own, and PC5/INSTALL on "
"the USB drive). Install it now? A game installed from there is moved into "
"PC5's library, out of the INSTALL folder."
msgstr ""
"Hay %d juego esperando en las carpetas INSTALL de PC5 (la suya y "
"PC5/INSTALL en la unidad USB). ¿Instalarlo ahora? Un juego instalado desde "
"ahí se mueve a la biblioteca de PC5, fuera de la carpeta INSTALL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7605
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d games are waiting in PC5's INSTALL folders (its own, and PC5/INSTALL on "
"the USB drive). Install them now? A game installed from there is moved "
"into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL folder."
msgstr ""
"Hay %d juegos esperando en las carpetas INSTALL de PC5 (la suya y "
"PC5/INSTALL en la unidad USB). ¿Instalarlos ahora? Un juego instalado "
"desde ahí se mueve a la biblioteca de PC5, fuera de la carpeta INSTALL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7605
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d game is waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install it now? A game "
"installed from there is moved into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Hay %d juego esperando en la carpeta INSTALL de PC5. ¿Instalarlo ahora? Un "
"juego instalado desde ahí se mueve a la biblioteca de PC5, fuera de la "
"carpeta INSTALL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7605
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d games are waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install them now? A game "
"installed from there is moved into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Hay %d juegos esperando en la carpeta INSTALL de PC5. ¿Instalarlos ahora? "
"Un juego instalado desde ahí se mueve a la biblioteca de PC5, fuera de la "
"carpeta INSTALL."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7617
msgid "Games in PC5's INSTALL folder"
msgstr "Juegos en la carpeta INSTALL de PC5"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7622
msgid "Updating the home screen tile"
msgstr "Actualizando el icono de la pantalla de inicio"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7622
msgid "Its picture and background"
msgstr "Su imagen y su fondo"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7624
msgid "A newer one may have fixed it"
msgstr "Puede que una versión más reciente lo haya solucionado"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7627
#, c-format
msgid "Update to PC5 %s first?"
msgstr "¿Actualizar primero a PC5 %s?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7629
#, c-format
msgid "You have %s"
msgstr "Tienes la %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7630
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This may already be fixed in it. Update, try the game again, and report it "
"if it still happens. %s."
msgstr ""
"Puede que ya esté solucionado en ella. Actualiza, vuelve a probar el juego "
"e reporta el problema si sigue ocurriendo. %s."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7633
msgid "Report anyway"
msgstr "Reportar de todos modos"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7638
#, c-format
msgid "Starting %s"
msgstr "Iniciando %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7641
#, c-format
msgid "Installing %.80s for it, once"
msgstr "Instalando %.80s para él, una sola vez"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7645
#, c-format
msgid "Setting up .NET for your games, once: %u of %u"
msgstr "Configurando .NET para tus juegos, una sola vez: %u de %u"

#: title/pc5_update.c:125
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 %s is available on GitHub"
msgstr "PC5 %s está disponible en GitHub"

#: title/pc5_update.c:126
#, c-format
msgid "You have the newest PC5 (%s)"
msgstr "Tienes el PC5 más reciente (%s)"

#: title/pc5_update.c:127
msgid "No PC5 release is published on GitHub yet"
msgstr "Aún no hay ninguna versión de PC5 publicada en GitHub"

#: title/pc5_update.c:128
msgid "GitHub didn't answer: is the console online?"
msgstr "GitHub no respondió: ¿está la consola conectada a internet?"

#: title/pc5_update.c:129
msgid "Not checked yet"
msgstr "Sin comprobar aún"

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:292
msgid "PC5 can't unpack this zip."
msgstr "PC5 no puede descomprimir este zip."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:296
msgid "The download can't be read."
msgstr "No se puede leer la descarga."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:311
msgid "The download is a zip PC5 can't read (ZIP64)."
msgstr "La descarga es un zip que PC5 no puede leer (ZIP64)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:340
#, c-format
msgid "The download holds a file PC5 won't unpack: %.120s"
msgstr "La descarga contiene un archivo que PC5 no descomprimirá: %.120s"

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:351
#, c-format
msgid "There isn't room on the drive to unpack it: it needs %s."
msgstr "No hay espacio en la unidad para descomprimirla: necesita %s."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:355
msgid "The folder to unpack it in can't be made."
msgstr "No se puede crear la carpeta donde descomprimirla."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:363 title/pc5_upgrade.c:1093 title/pc5_upgrade.c:1244
#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1328 title/pc5_upgrade.c:1355
msgid "Cancelled."
msgstr "Cancelado."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:408
msgid "The download is damaged (a file in it doesn't match its checksum)."
msgstr ""
"La descarga está dañada (un archivo no coincide con su suma de "
"comprobación)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:411
#, c-format
msgid "Files can't be written on the drive (%s)."
msgstr "No se pueden escribir archivos en la unidad (%s)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:414
msgid "PC5 ran out of memory unpacking it."
msgstr "PC5 se quedó sin memoria al descomprimirla."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:417
msgid "The download isn't a zip PC5 can read."
msgstr "La descarga no es un zip que PC5 pueda leer."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:589 title/pc5_upgrade.c:710 title/pc5_upgrade.c:1316
msgid "A path in PC5's folder is too long."
msgstr "Una ruta de la carpeta de PC5 es demasiado larga."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:597
#, c-format
msgid ""
"PC5's folder has %.100s where the new version has a %s of that name. Move "
"it out of the folder and try again."
msgstr ""
"La carpeta de PC5 tiene %.100s donde la nueva versión tiene un %s con ese "
"nombre. Sácalo de la carpeta y vuelve a intentarlo."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:713
#, c-format
msgid "A new file is missing: %.200s."
msgstr "Falta un archivo nuevo: %.200s."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:716
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 can't put its new files in place (%.150s: %s)."
msgstr "PC5 no puede colocar sus archivos nuevos (%.150s: %s)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1085 title/pc5_upgrade.c:1105
#, c-format
msgid "The download can't be saved (%s)."
msgstr "No se puede guardar la descarga (%s)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1095
#, c-format
msgid "GitHub answered the download with an error (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "GitHub respondió a la descarga con un error (HTTP %d)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1096
#, c-format
msgid "The download stopped (%d). Is the console still online?"
msgstr "La descarga se detuvo (%d). ¿Sigue la consola conectada a internet?"

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1097
msgid "The download was cut short."
msgstr "La descarga se interrumpió."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1103
msgid "The download doesn't match the checksum GitHub lists for it."
msgstr ""
"La descarga no coincide con la suma de comprobación que indica GitHub."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1277
msgid "GitHub didn't answer. Is the console online?"
msgstr "GitHub no respondió. ¿Está la consola conectada a internet?"

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1279
#, c-format
msgid "You already have the newest PC5 (%s)."
msgstr "Ya tienes el PC5 más reciente (%s)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1282
#, c-format
msgid ""
"PC5 %s's release on GitHub has no %s.zip to install. Download it from "
"GitHub instead."
msgstr ""
"La versión de PC5 %s en GitHub no tiene un %s.zip que instalar. Descárgalo "
"de GitHub en su lugar."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1286
#, c-format
msgid ""
"PC5 is on the console more than once (%.200s and %.200s), so it can't tell "
"which to update. Delete the copy you don't use, or install PC5 %s from "
"GitHub as before."
msgstr ""
"PC5 está en la consola más de una vez (%.200s y %.200s), así que no sabe "
"cuál actualizar. Elimina la copia que no uses o instala PC5 %s desde "
"GitHub como antes."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1290
#, c-format
msgid ""
"PC5's folder wasn't found on the console's drives (in homebrew, "
"etaHEN/games or at the top of a drive). Install PC5 %s from GitHub as "
"before."
msgstr ""
"No se encontró la carpeta de PC5 en las unidades de la consola (en "
"homebrew, etaHEN/games o en la raíz de una unidad). Instala PC5 %s desde "
"GitHub como antes."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1297
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 can't update itself where it is (%s)."
msgstr "PC5 no puede actualizarse donde está (%s)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1299
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 can't write to its folder (%s)."
msgstr "PC5 no puede escribir en su carpeta (%s)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1303
msgid ""
"An earlier update isn't finished. Close PC5 and open it again: it finishes "
"it then."
msgstr ""
"Una actualización anterior no ha terminado. Cierra PC5 y vuelve a abrirlo: "
"la terminará entonces."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1309
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 can't make its work folder (%s)."
msgstr "PC5 no puede crear su carpeta de trabajo (%s)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1326
#, c-format
msgid ""
"There isn't room on PC5's drive for the update: it needs about %s free."
msgstr ""
"No hay espacio en la unidad de PC5 para la actualización: necesita unos %s "
"libres."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1339 title/pc5_upgrade.c:1378
msgid "The work folder can't be written."
msgstr "No se puede escribir en la carpeta de trabajo."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1345
#, c-format
msgid "The download isn't PC5 (%s is missing something)."
msgstr "La descarga no es PC5 (a %s le falta algo)."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1346
msgid "The work folder can't be read."
msgstr "No se puede leer la carpeta de trabajo."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1390
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%.120s Close PC5 and open it again: it finishes the update then. If it "
"still can't, install PC5 %s from GitHub."
msgstr ""
"%.120s Cierra PC5 y vuelve a abrirlo: terminará la actualización entonces. "
"Si sigue sin poder, instala PC5 %s desde GitHub."

#: title/pc5_upgrade.c:1449
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 can't start the update (%d)."
msgstr "PC5 no puede empezar la actualización (%d)."

#: title/pc5_web.c:708
msgid "It isn't UTF-8 text"
msgstr "No es texto UTF-8"

